        "slc_9865b5bf1e54e468e1f062f2c3f2092e79e3343672dd7b42822aceeac16c7dea"
      ],
      "text": "The product supports multiple model families (sonnet-4-*, grok-*, gpt-5-*, opus-4-*), with Ollama for local LLMs and OpenRouter for a long tail of providers."
    },
