        "slc_f88e96c89975644bce5d8578d7c92219c7f0d6dc11a5ae1905e17789a43e10f9"
      ],
      "text": "Tool hooks let users run their own scripts around tool executions: `.xum/tool_pre` runs before every tool and a non-zero exit blocks the tool with the error shown to the agent; `.xum/tool_post` runs after tools and reports failures via hook_output."
    },
